# astrion-skill v1
goal: Extract every TODO line from your notes into one view
trigger:
  - phrase: "find todos"
  - phrase: "scan for todos"
  - phrase: "loose todos"
do: |
  Scan every Notes app note for lines starting with "TODO", "[ ]",
  or "- []". Collect them with the source note title. Open a new
  Notes app note titled "Loose TODOs — YYYY-MM-DD" listing each
  TODO with a link back to its source note. Highlights items the
  user wrote down but never moved to the Todos app.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 400
  reversibility: BOUNDED
